Description: The peakfq package implements the Bulletin 17C procedures for flood-frequency analysis of streamflow records, computing estimates of flood magnitudes and their corresponding variance for a range of annual exceedance probabilities. Users should be famililar with Guidelines for Determining Flood Flow Frequency Bulletin 17C which can be accessed at: doi.org/10.3133/tm4B5.
